 ### Partially Learned Gradient Descent (With Regularizer)
-Includes a Tikhonov-like regularization term (adjoint of partial derivatives) in the network input concatenation. Input channels are $n_{memory} + 3$ (estimate, data gradient, regularization gradient, memory). Weights $W_1$ shape: `[3, 3, n_memory + 3, 32]` [S1, unofficial].
