 ### Sample Reuse
-A technique to reuse samples from the previous gradient-descent iteration at the current iteration by merging reservoirs from current and previous iterations, treating different iterations as different frames. Handles sign changes by reusing both positive and negative samples for both reservoirs. $M_{cap}$ is typically 32 for base color, 16 otherwise [S2].
